<http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/pim/contact#Male> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> <https://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/pim/contact> .
