<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#ContainerMembershipProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The class of container membership properties, rdf:_1, rdf:_2, ..., all of which are sub-properties of 'member'." <https://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema> .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#ContainerMembershipProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> <https://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema> .
