<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrowerTransitive> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "skos:narrowerTransitive is a transitive superproperty of skos:narrower." <https://www.w3.org/2009/08/skos-reference/skos.rdf> .
