<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#memberList> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an ordered collection to the RDF list containing its members."@en <https://www.w3.org/2009/08/skos-reference/skos.rdf> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#memberList> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> <https://www.w3.org/2009/08/skos-reference/skos.rdf> .
