<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrowMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core> <https://www.w3.org/2009/08/skos-reference/skos.rdf> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrowMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "skos:narrowMatch is used to state a hierarchical mapping link between two conceptual resources in different concept schemes."@en <https://www.w3.org/2009/08/skos-reference/skos.rdf> .
