<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrowMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#mappingRelation> <https://www.w3.org/2009/08/skos-reference/skos.rdf> .
