<http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#moreinfo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "more info" <https://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns> .
<http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#moreinfo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "more information about the status etc of a term, typically human oriented" <https://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns> .
<http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#moreinfo> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "unstable" <https://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns> .
