<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AllDisjointClasses> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> <https://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl> .
<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AllDisjointClasses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The class of collections of pairwise disjoint classes." <https://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl> .
