<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/mbox> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A  personal mailbox, ie. an Internet mailbox associated with exactly one owner, the first owner of this mailbox. This is a 'static inverse functional property', in that  there is (across time and change) at most one individual that ever has any particular value for foaf:mbox." <https://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/PersonalProfileDocument> .
